~ start
PILI: [speed=1.0]Eat up, children. The wind's getting chilly tonight, so finish your soup while it's still warm.[/speed]

[speed=1.2][wave amp=2 freq=3]Mmm! Nanay's sinigang! My favorite![/wave][/speed]

VALERIE: [speed=1.1]Dodong, close your mouth when you're chewing! And Noni, sit properly. You're going to spill your soup![/speed]

DODONG: [speed=1.3]Look, Noni! I bet I can swallow this whole fish tail in one bite![/speed]

NONI: [speed=1.4][shake rate=5 level=3]No, Kuya! Don't! You're gonna CHOKE![/shake][/speed]

KIKI: [speed=1.5][wave amp=5 freq=5]Fish! Nom-nom![/wave][/speed]

VALERIE: [speed=1.2]Dodong! Stop messing around! And Noni, don't encourage him! [shake rate=3 level=2]Can you two just eat properly for once?[/shake][/speed]

DODONG: [speed=1.2]I'm eating, Ate! See?[/speed]

VALERIE: [speed=1.2]That's not what I-[/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.9]Valerie, anak, lower your voice. Let them eat.[/speed]

PILI: [speed=1.0]Dodong, Noni, listen to your Ate, okay? And don't play with your food.[/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.8][i]We should be thankful for what we have.[/i][/speed]

DODONG: [speed=1.4][wave amp=4 freq=4]Yes, ma'am! Wee-woo! Wee-woo! The food police are here![/wave][/speed]

NONI: [speed=1.5][wave amp=4 freq=4]The food police![/wave][/speed]

VALERIE: [speed=1.3]Tatay! See what I mean?! I'm just trying to keep them from making a mess so Nanay doesn't have to clean up after everyone and they won't even listen![/speed] 

VALERIE: [speed=1.0][shake rate=5 level=3]UGH![/shake][/speed]

#[Tatay sets his glass down with a heavy THUD. Everyone falls quiet.]

[speed=0.5][shake rate=2 level=2]Uh-oh...[/shake][/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=0.9]Alright, that's enough.[/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=0.8]We're here to eat, not argue.[/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=1.0]Besides, I've got some good news for everyone.[/speed]

PILI: [speed=1.1]Good news? What happened, Ernesto?[/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=1.0]The boss from Millgate called me this afternoon.[/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=1.1]They want to buy our entire copra harvest this month and they're offering a much better price than the middlemen![/speed]

PILI: [speed=1.3][wave amp=3 freq=3]Salamat sa Diyos![/wave][/speed]

PILI: [speed=1.2]Are you serious, Ernesto?[/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=1.0]I am.[/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=0.9]If everything goes well, we should finally have enough to pay off some of our debts and take care of the things we've been putting off.[/speed]

NONI: [speed=1.4][wave amp=4 freq=4]Really, Tay?! The BIG company?![/wave][/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=1.1]That's right, anak.[/speed]

DODONG: [speed=1.3][wave amp=3 freq=4]Whoa! Then we can finally fix the backyard! And maybe get that basketball I've been asking for![/wave][/speed]

VALERIE: [speed=1.2]Dodong! [shake rate=3 level=2]Don't start spending the money before we've even earned it![/shake][/speed]

DODONG: [speed=1.2]I'm just saying![/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.9]Still, this is a blessing.[/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.8]We've been worrying about money for weeks.[/speed]

VALERIE: [speed=1.0]Then... maybe we can afford to make Ollie a chocolate cake for his birthday?[/speed]

VALERIE: [speed=1.1]It's in two days, Nay. I can help you bake it![/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.9]We'll see, anak. We still have to make sure everything goes well with the harvest.[/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=0.9]Your Nanay's right. We've still got work to do, and the weather's not looking too good.[/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=1.0]But this deal gives us a chance to catch up on things.[/speed]

VALERIE: [speed=1.2][wave amp=2 freq=3]That's okay! We can still make him a cake, right, Nay?[/wave][/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.9]We'll see what we can do.[/speed]

NONI: [speed=1.5][wave amp=4 freq=4]Yay! Kuya Ollie's birthday![/wave][/speed]

[speed=0.7]Millgate must be a magical place![/speed]

[speed=0.8]They're going to give us lots of money![/speed]

[speed=0.7]Maybe Tatay won't have to work so hard anymore.[/speed]

[speed=0.6]Maybe I'll get a real birthday party this year...[/speed]

NONI: [speed=1.3][wave amp=3 freq=4]Kuya Ollie! I'll give you my BEST drawing for your birthday![/wave][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=1.2][wave amp=2 freq=3]Really? Thank you, Noni![/wave][/speed]

DODONG: [speed=1.2]We should celebrate! Kuya Andrei said the Millgate trucks are HUGE! I wanna see them load up all our coconuts![/speed]

VALERIE: [speed=1.0]One thing at a time, Dodong! We still have work to do before any of that happens.[/speed]

DODONG: [speed=1.2]I know, I know! I'm just excited![/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.9]We all are, anak. Let's just hope everything goes well.[/speed]

VALERIE: [speed=1.1][wave amp=2 freq=3]See, Ollie? Maybe you'll get that birthday party you wanted after all![/wave][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=1.0][wave amp=2 freq=3]Yay![/wave][/speed]

[speed=0.8]Ate Valerie's right.[/speed]

[speed=0.7]Everything's gonna be okay—[/speed]

#[SFX: BZZZZT.]
=> END